sequence
title "A retried payment is charged once"

pill client [user]: Client
api [api]: Payments API
store keys [database]: Idempotency keys
psp [landmark]: Card provider

client -> api : POST /charge  (Idempotency-Key: k1)
api -> keys : look up k1
keys --> api : not seen
api -> keys : store k1 as in progress
api -> psp : charge 20 EUR
psp --> api : approved
api -> keys : store k1 with the result
api --> client : 200 charged

note over client, api : the connection drops before the reply arrives
client -> api : POST /charge  (same key k1)
api -> keys : look up k1
keys --> api : done, with the stored result
opt "k1 was still in progress" {
  api --> client : 409 retry shortly
}
api --> client : 200 the same result, no second charge
